# Copy to .env.local (not committed) to change the settings for your machine.

# Base URL of the backend API. Leave it out to use the mock backend that the
# Vite dev and preview servers serve on /api (see mock-server/plugin.ts).
# VITE_API_URL=https://blip-test.example.se/api

# Address of an application's page in the other internal system, opened from
# the link column in the Applikationer list. "{id}" is replaced by the
# application's id. Leave it out to use the mock page in this app.
# VITE_INTERNT_SYSTEM_URL=https://internt.example.se/applikation/{id}
